      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24518482639159296
    m_Localized: "Seviyelerde \xE7e\u015Fitli mallar satan t\xFCccarlar bulabilirsiniz."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24558171962179584
    m_Localized: "D\xFCnyan\u0131n bir\xE7ok s\u0131cak noktas\u0131n\u0131 ziyaret
      etmi\u015F deneyimli bir sava\u015F\xE7\u0131. \xD6d\xFCllerini listelemek
      uzun zaman al\u0131r ama kesin olan bir \u015Fey var ki o da Rambo'nun en iyilerin
      en iyisi, silahl\u0131 kuvvetlerin ger\xE7ek se\xE7kinleri oldu\u011Fu. Rambo
      yak\u0131n d\xF6v\xFC\u015F silahlar\u0131nda yeteneklidir.\r\nSMG'lerin ve
      pompal\u0131 t\xFCfeklerin hasar\u0131na, kullan\u0131m h\u0131z\u0131na ve
      ate\u015Fleme h\u0131z\u0131na +%20.\r\nT\xFCm silahlar\u0131n -%10 do\u011Frulu\u011Fu."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24565575860846592
    m_Localized: "Booth, casusluk operasyonlar\u0131nda uzmanla\u015Fm\u0131\u015F
      deneyimli bir ajand\u0131r. Son derece gizemli biri, ka\xE7 operasyona kat\u0131ld\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131,
      hatta ka\xE7 ya\u015F\u0131nda oldu\u011Funu veya ad\u0131n\u0131n ger\xE7ekten
      Booth olup olmad\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 s\xF6ylemek zor. Pek \xE7ok ter\xF6r
      \xF6rg\xFCt\xFCn\xFC ortadan kald\u0131rd\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 ve birden
      fazlas\u0131n\u0131 da ortadan kald\u0131rd\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 ancak
      g\xFCvenle s\xF6yleyebiliriz.\r\nTabanca hasar\u0131 +%50.\r\nTabanca ve makineli
      t\xFCfek kullanma h\u0131z\u0131 +%10."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24565592822611968
    m_Localized: Boot
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24565614632992768
    m_Localized: Rambo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24565635059253248
    m_Localized: "G\xF6lge"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24565712016343040
    m_Localized: "G\xF6lge, yaln\u0131zl\u0131\u011F\u0131 herhangi bir arkada\u015Fl\u0131\u011Fa
      tercih eden, sonsuza kadar sessiz bir ki\u015Fidir. M\xFCtevaz\u0131 do\u011Fas\u0131n\u0131n
      arkas\u0131nda kurbanlar\u0131na hi\xE7 \u015Fans b\u0131rakmayan bir cinayet
      ustas\u0131 vard\u0131r. D\xFCnyada G\xF6lge'nin kur\u015Funundan saklanabilecek
      hi\xE7 kimse yok.\r\nKeskin ni\u015Fanc\u0131 t\xFCfekleri i\xE7in +%20 hasar.\r\nKeskin
      ni\u015Fanc\u0131 t\xFCfe\u011Fi kullanma h\u0131z\u0131na +%25.\r\nT\xFCm
      silahlar i\xE7in +%25 do\u011Fruluk ve -%20 at\u0131\u015F oran\u0131.\r\n+%5
      kritik sald\u0131r\u0131 \u015Fans\u0131."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24565760913539072
    m_Localized: Son Kan
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24565942598205440
    m_Localized: "Etkinle\u015Ftirildi\u011Finde Rambo bir s\xFCreli\u011Fine ac\u0131
      hissetmeyi ve hasar almay\u0131 b\u0131rak\u0131r.\r\nAl\u0131nan bir sonraki
      hasar \xF6l\xFCmc\xFClse ve yetenek kullan\u0131ma haz\u0131rsa otomatik olarak
      etkinle\u015Fecektir."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24565980846063616
    m_Localized: Rezervler
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24566015482626048
    m_Localized: "Etkinle\u015Ftirildi\u011Finde %10 sa\u011Fl\u0131k ve %5 z\u0131rh
      verir."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24567533216694272
    m_Localized: "Yetene\u011Fi kullanmak zaman\u0131 bir s\xFCreli\u011Fine yava\u015Flat\u0131r.\r\nRakipler
      Booth'a g\xF6re daha fazla yava\u015Fl\u0131yor."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24567566334918656
    m_Localized: Akut reaksiyon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24590482539773952
    m_Localized: "Sonraki 4 at\u0131\u015F %20 daha fazla hasar verecektir."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
